    <span class="hero-scroll-line"></span>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= FEATURED GAME ================= -->
<section id="game" class="feature">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-tag" data-en="Featured Title" data-tr="Öne Çıkan Oyun" data-jp="注目タイトル" data-ru="Главный проект">Featured Title</span>
      <h2 class="display-title" data-en="The Game" data-tr="Oyun" data-jp="ゲーム" data-ru="Игра">The Game</h2>
      <p data-en="One door. One path. Once you step inside, nothing looks the same." data-tr="Tek bir kapı. Tek bir yol. İçeri adım attığın anda hiçbir şey aynı görünmeyecek." data-jp="ひとつの扉。ひとつの道。中に入ったら、もう何も同じには見えない。" data-ru="Одна дверь. Один путь. Шагнув внутрь, вы уже не увидите мир прежним.">One door. One path. Once you step inside, nothing looks the same.</p>
    </div>
    <% if (mainGame) { %>
    <div class="feature-layout">
      <div class="feature-media tilt">
        <div class="feature-image">
          <img src="<%= mainGame.image %>" alt="<%= mainGame.title %>">
          <div class="feature-image-frame"></div>
          <span class="feature-status"><%= mainGame.tag %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-media-meta">
          <div class="media-stat">
            <span class="media-stat-num"><%= mainGame.releaseDate %></span>
            <span class="media-stat-label" data-en="Release Date" data-tr="Çıkış Tarihi" data-jp="リリース日" data-ru="Дата релиза">Release Date</span>
          </div>
          <div class="media-stat">
            <span class="media-stat-num">EN · TR · JP · RU</span>
            <span class="media-stat-label" data-en="Languages" data-tr="Diller" data-jp="対応言語" data-ru="Языки">Languages</span>
          </div>
          <div class="media-stat">
            <span class="media-stat-num">PC</span>
            <span class="media-stat-label" data-en="Platform" data-tr="Platform" data-jp="プラットフォーム" data-ru="Платформа">Platform</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-info">
        <h3 class="feature-name"><%= mainGame.title %></h3>
        <div class="feature-badges">
          <span class="badge badge-status game-status game-status-en"><%= mainGame.statusEN %></span>
          <span class="badge badge-status-tr game-status-tr" style="display:none"><%= mainGame.statusTR %></span>
          <span class="badge badge-status-jp game-status-jp" style="display:none"><%= mainGame.statusJP %></span>
          <span class="badge badge-status-ru game-status-ru" style="display:none"><%= mainGame.statusRU %></span>
          <span class="badge"><%= mainGame.tag %></span>
          <span class="badge">Single Player</span>
        </div>
        <p class="feature-desc game-desc game-desc-en"><%= mainGame.fullDescEN %></p>
        <p class="feature-desc game-desc game-desc-tr" style="display:none"><%= mainGame.fullDescTR %></p>
        <p class="feature-desc game-desc game-desc-jp" style="display:none"><%= mainGame.fullDescJP %></p>
        <p class="feature-desc game-desc game-desc-ru" style="display:none"><%= mainGame.fullDescRU %></p>
        <div class="feature-features">
          <span class="feature-chip">
            <span class="chip-icon">👁️</span>
            <span data-en="Story-driven horror" data-tr="Hikaye odaklı korku" data-jp="ストーリー重視のホラー" data-ru="Сюжетный хоррор">Story-driven horror</span>
          </span>
          <span class="feature-chip">
            <span class="chip-icon">🌫️</span>
            <span data-en="Atmospheric dread" data-tr="Atmosferik dehşet" data-jp="重い空気の恐怖" data-ru="Атмосферный ужас">Atmospheric dread</span>
          </span>
          <span class="feature-chip">
            <span class="chip-icon">📜</span>
            <span data-en="Experimental narrative" data-tr="Deneysel anlatı" data-jp="実験的な物語" data-ru="Экспериментальный сюжет">Experimental narrative</span>
          </span>
          <span class="feature-chip">
            <span class="chip-icon">🎮</span>
            <span data-en="Immersive sound design" data-tr="Sarmalayan ses tasarımı" data-jp="没入感のある音響" data-ru="Погружающий звук">Immersive sound design</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-actions">
          <a href="/games/<%= mainGame.id %>" class="btn btn-primary">
            <span data-en="Learn More" data-tr="Daha Fazla" data-jp="詳細を見る" data-ru="Подробнее">Learn More</span>
          </a>
          <a href="<%= mainGame.trailer %>" target="_blank" class="btn btn-ghost">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
            <span data-en="Watch Trailer" data-tr="Fragmanı İzle" data-jp="予告編を見る" data-ru="Смотреть трейлер">Watch Trailer</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <% } else { %>
    <div class="feature-empty">
      <p data-en="New horrors are being crafted. Check back soon." data-tr="Yeni korkular şekilleniyor. Çok yakında burada." data-jp="新しい恐怖が形になりつつある。また近いうちに。" data-ru="Новые ужасы создаются. Загляните позже.">New horrors are being crafted. Check back soon.</p>
    </div>
    <% } %>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= FOUNDERS ================= -->
<section id="founders" class="founders">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-tag" data-en="The Minds Behind It" data-tr="Arkasındaki Zihinler" data-jp="創設者" data-ru="Создатели">The Minds Behind It</span>
      <h2 class="display-title" data-en="The Founders" data-tr="Kurucular" data-jp="創設者" data-ru="Основатели">The Founders</h2>
      <p data-en="Two minds. One nightmare. Meet the pillars of GhostPath Studio." data-tr="İki zihin. Tek bir kabus. GhostPath Studio'nun temel direkleriyle tanışın." data-jp="二つの心。ひとつの悪夢。GhostPath Studioの柱に会おう。" data-ru="Два разума. Один кошмар. Познакомьтесь с опорами GhostPath Studio.">Two minds. One nightmare. Meet the pillars of GhostPath Studio.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="founders-grid">
      <div class="founder-card">
        <div class="founder-avatar zetagg"><span class="avatar-initials">ZG</span></div>
        <h3>ZeTaGG</h3>
        <div class="founder-roles">
          <span class="role-badge">🎨 <span data-en="Model Designer" data-tr="Model Tasarımcısı" data-jp="モデルデザイナー" data-ru="Модельер">Model Designer</span></span>
          <span class="role-badge">🗺️ <span data-en="Map Designer" data-tr="Harita Tasarımcısı" data-jp="マップデザイナー" data-ru="Дизайнер карт">Map Designer</span></span>
        </div>
        <p data-en="The architect of our worlds — crafting every model and map with painstaking detail." data-tr="Dünyalarımızın mimarı — her modeli ve haritayı titizlikle işliyor." data-jp="世界の設計者 — 細部までこだわり抜いたモデルとマップを制作。" data-ru="Архитектор наших миров — создаёт каждую модель и карту с кропотливой детализацией.">The architect of our worlds — crafting every model and map with painstaking detail.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="founder-card">
        <div class="founder-avatar revaxx"><span class="avatar-initials">RX</span></div>
        <h3>ReVaXX</h3>
        <div class="founder-roles">
          <span class="role-badge role-founder">👑 <span data-en="Founder" data-tr="Kurucu" data-jp="創設者" data-ru="Основатель">Founder</span></span>
          <span class="role-badge">💻 <span data-en="Developer" data-tr="Geliştirici" data-jp="開発者" data-ru="Разработчик">Developer</span></span>
          <span class="role-badge">📖 <span data-en="Game Writer" data-tr="Oyun Yazarı" data-jp="ゲームライター" data-ru="Сценарист">Game Writer</span></span>
        </div>
        <p data-en="The mind behind the code and the stories — bringing nightmares to life." data-tr="Kodların ve hikayelerin arkasındaki zihin — kabusları hayata geçiriyor." data-jp="コードと物語の背後にある精神 — 悪夢を現実に。" data-ru="Разум, стоящий за кодом и историями — воплощающий кошмары в реальность.">The mind behind the code and the stories — bringing nightmares to life.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= NEWS ================= -->
<section id="news" class="news-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-tag" data-en="Latest" data-tr="Son Haberler" data-jp="最新情報" data-ru="Последнее">Latest</span>
      <h2 class="display-title" data-en="News & Updates" data-tr="Haberler & Güncellemeler" data-jp="ニュース＆アップデート" data-ru="Новости и обновления">News & Updates</h2>
      <p data-en="Signals from the dark. Stay up to date with GhostPath Studio." data-tr="Karanlıktan gelen sinyaller. GhostPath Studio'dan haberdar olun." data-jp="暗闇からの信号。GhostPath Studioの最新情報をチェック。" data-ru="Сигналы из тьмы. Будьте в курсе новостей GhostPath Studio.">Signals from the dark. Stay up to date with GhostPath Studio.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="news-card-link">
      <a href="/news" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" data-en="Enter the Newsroom →" data-tr="Haberleri Görüntüle →" data-jp="ニュースを見る →" data-ru="Смотреть новости →">Enter the Newsroom →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= ABOUT ================= -->
<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-content">
        <span class="section-tag" data-en="About Us" data-tr="Hakkımızda" data-jp="私たちについて" data-ru="О нас">About Us</span>
        <h2 class="display-title" data-en="Who We Are" data-tr="Biz Kimiz" data-jp="私たちは" data-ru="Кто мы">Who We Are</h2>
        <div class="about-text-en">
          <p>We're a small indie horror game team from Türkiye, passionate about crafting unsettling and atmospheric experiences. GhostPath Studio focuses on creating stories that blend fear, mystery, and emotion — where every sound and shadow matters.</p>
          <p>Our goal isn't perfection — it's immersion. We experiment, learn, and evolve with every project we make. Feedback and honest criticism are always welcome — that's how we grow.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-text-tr" style="display:none">
          <p>Türkiye'den küçük bir bağımsız korku oyunu ekibiyiz. Rahatsız edici ve atmosferik deneyimler yaratmaya tutkuluyuz. GhostPath Studio, korku, gizem ve duyguyu harmanlayan hikayeler oluşturmaya odaklanır — her ses ve her gölgenin önemli olduğu bir dünya.</p>
          <p>Hedefimiz mükemmellik değil — etkileyicilik. Her projemizle deney yapıyor, öğreniyor ve gelişiyoruz. Geri bildirim ve dürüst eleştiri her zaman hoş karşılanır — böyle büyüyoruz.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-text-jp" style="display:none">
          <p>私たちはトルコの小さなインディーホラーゲームチームです。不安で幻想的な体験を創り出すことに情熱を注いでいます。GhostPath Studioは、恐怖、謎、感情が融合した物語を紡ぎます — すべての音と影に意味がある世界。</p>
          <p>私たちの目標は完璧さではありません — 没入感です。プロジェクトごとに実験し、学び、進化し続けます。フィードバックと正直な批評はいつでも歓迎します — それが成長の糧です。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-text-ru" style="display:none">
          <p>Мы — небольшая инди-команда разработчиков хорроров из Турции, увлечённая созданием тревожных и атмосферных игр. GhostPath Studio фокусируется на историях, в которых переплетаются страх, тайна и эмоции — где каждый звук и каждая тень имеют значение.</p>
          <p>Наша цель — не совершенство, а погружение. Мы экспериментируем, учимся и развиваемся с каждым проектом. Обратная связь и честная критика всегда приветствуются — так мы растем.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-values">
